 has 75 years of record on its 6 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, March to April and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years. In 2025, March to April hit 183% of normal on the middle, and November to December fell to 55%. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 21140 at 46%.</p>"}
